\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Accuracy--compliance Pareto frontier. Each model is positioned by MSE ($x$-axis) and BVR ($y$-axis), with bubble size proportional to Mean Violation Severity (MVS). PhysFormer uniquely occupies the lower-left corner, achieving near-best accuracy with near-zero boundary violations. Autoformer and DLinear are excluded due to their high MSE values (above 0.10) to maintain visual resolution among the competitive tier.}}{8}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pareto}{{4}{8}{Accuracy--compliance Pareto frontier. Each model is positioned by MSE ($x$-axis) and BVR ($y$-axis), with bubble size proportional to Mean Violation Severity (MVS). PhysFormer uniquely occupies the lower-left corner, achieving near-best accuracy with near-zero boundary violations. Autoformer and DLinear are excluded due to their high MSE values (above 0.10) to maintain visual resolution among the competitive tier}{figure.4}{}}
